Description: |
  Web library cell — the prettyplay capability's library surface: the prettyplay settings
  materialization of the validated web config (no mirror model — the cell declares no config
  models of its own), the per-test generation-prompt decorator, the page-object base (BasePage —
  the tested-site page binding the web runtime and a path over the site.base_url directive),
  the Allure step reporting hooks, and the console event log formatter. The web plugin itself
  (the web fixture, the strict/interactive options), the web config key set, and the document
  validation live in the plugins cell (goga_tool_pybuggy/plugins), activated by its installation
  gate on the presence of the web config document.
